  "title": "Is there a bug on the forum when viewing \"topics\" and \"replies\"?",
  "content": "<p>Hello everyone, I’d like to report two issues I’m experiencing with the forum:</p><ol><li>When I go to my profile, under ‘Topics’, and open any topic, I get this error page. However, if I open that thread from the notification panel , then it does open it for me. I’ve compared the two URLs and the endings are different.<br /><br />\t2) In a thread (the only one) that opens, when I click on ‘show previous replies’, the replies don’t load – nothing happens. I’ve tried several devices and several browsers</li></ol><p> </p><p> </p><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/ba550553-40be-478a-9837-8d9e94745378.png\" /></figure><p> </p>",
